{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2d<strong> Hot Dog Truck Simulator</strong> invites you into a fast-paced, flavor-filled street food adventure from bustling city streets to lively festivals, crowded events, and many more areas to unlock, all packed with hungry customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9a Fire up the grill, prep your buns, squeeze those sauces, and serve your next order! But don\u2019t forget  this job isn\u2019t just about making hot dogs. <strong>Inventory management, cleanliness, customer satisfaction, and time management</strong> are all part of the hustle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2a Ingredient handling takes precision!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just about ketchup and bread. Buns, sausages, ketchup, mustard, mayo, fries, and more await. Slice, grill, assemble  and above all, serve on time. Customers won\u2019t wait forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/3ab0086cc982a6d57ddf5a896090f5f1.poster.avif?t=1759131223\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/3ab0086cc982a6d57ddf5a896090f5f1.webm?t=1759131223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/3ab0086cc982a6d57ddf5a896090f5f1.mp4?t=1759131223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uded2 Restock before you run out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empty fridges mean angry customers. Keep your supplies fresh by ordering essentials like sausages, buns, drinks, and fries from your in-game computer. But watch your cash  pay the bills first, then restock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/e23a018da159ee8b53c4ff44430322cc.poster.avif?t=1759131223\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/e23a018da159ee8b53c4ff44430322cc.webm?t=1759131223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/e23a018da159ee8b53c4ff44430322cc.mp4?t=1759131223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 Take orders, get paid, keep them happy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers are lining up. Fulfill each order accurately and quickly. Happy customers leave tips  and boost your reputation.<br><strong>More smiles = more money!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/9f82697cc011918448aa278f39e3d282.poster.avif?t=1759131223\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/9f82697cc011918448aa278f39e3d282.webm?t=1759131223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/9f82697cc011918448aa278f39e3d282.mp4?t=1759131223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Don\u2019t overcook it... or undercook it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burnt sausages? Cold centers? Not on your watch! Timing is everything when grilling  and every small mistake can affect your kitchen\u2019s performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/2f4d16509b5d60ccbaf5b0eee37c619c.poster.avif?t=1759131223\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/2f4d16509b5d60ccbaf5b0eee37c619c.webm?t=1759131223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/2f4d16509b5d60ccbaf5b0eee37c619c.mp4?t=1759131223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddfd Clean it up, or they\u2019ll talk!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sauce spills, fries on the floor, and overflowing bins won\u2019t go unnoticed. Neglecting your hygiene will cost you ratings  and customers may start posting about your mess online!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/51fc14ee80929cdad26cd12c6b31cb5d.poster.avif?t=1759131223\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/51fc14ee80929cdad26cd12c6b31cb5d.webm?t=1759131223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/extras/51fc14ee80929cdad26cd12c6b31cb5d.mp4?t=1759131223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3109560?t=1759131223","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/f2f0e7796979d8bf18d198d38f000ce7b83dd436/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759131223","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109560/dc48633fbaadfc6ee5586abac791da0cc10010ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17591312